# Personal career notes stay local. Keep only the vault instructions and generic
# templates under version control unless the user explicitly chooses otherwise.
.obsidian/
01 Profile/*
02 Experience/*
03 Projects/*
04 Skills/*
05 Evidence/*
06 Stories/*
99 Archive/*
07 Applications/01 Active/*
!07 Applications/01 Active/.gitkeep
07 Applications/99 Archive/*
!07 Applications/99 Archive/.gitkeep
!.gitkeep
